   n_clusters        number of clusters
   n_points          total number of points
   n_clustered       number of points in clusters
   n_isolated        number of points not in clusters
   indices           array of boundary indices relative to the array of x,y
                     locations per cluster
   indicesConvex     as indices but for convex hull boundaries (shrink = 0)
   indicesTight      as indices but for the tightest alpha-shape boundaries
                     (shrink = 1)
   area              area of each cluster
   areaConvex        area of each cluster using the convex hull boundary
   areaTight         area of each cluster using the tightest boundary
   perimeter         perimeter of each cluster
   perimeterConvex   perimeter of each cluster using the convex hull boundary
   perimeterTight    perimeter of each cluster using the tightest boundary
   center            x,y center of each cluster
   equiv_radius      equivalent radius of each cluster: sqrt(area / pi) / 2
   compactness       4 pi area / perimeter^2 of each cluster
                        [1 for a circle; 0 for a line segment]
   circularity       4 pi areaTight / perimeterConvex^2 of each cluster
                        [1 for a circle; < 1 for non-circular, but relatively
                         insensitive to irregular boundaries]
   convexity         perimeterConvex / perimeterTight of each cluster
                        [1 for a convex object; < 1 if non-convex, e.g., one
                         having an irregular boundary]
   solidity          areaTight / areaConvex of each cluster
                        [1 for a solid object; < 1 if irregular boundary or
                         containing holes]
   n_pts_per_cluster number of points per cluster
   n_pts_per_area    number of points per area for clusters containing 3 or
                     more points
   sigma_actual      actual (computed) sigma of each cluster, that is, the
                     standard deviation of the intracluster distances
   cluster_width     maximum distance between vertices in each cluster
   min_c2c_dists     minimum center-to-center distances for each cluster
                     with respect to all the others
   min_e2e_dists     minimum edge-to-edge distances for each cluster convex
                     hull with respect to all the others
   min_c2c_dist      min(min_c2c_dists)
   min_e2e_dist      min(min_e2e_dists)
   nn_within_clusters nearest neighbor distances between points within
                     clusters only

